WEBVTT

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:02.097
i cili ka thene, "Edukimi nuk eshte njesoj me mbushjen e kovave;

00:18:02.097 --> 00:18:04.250
eshte njesoj me ndezjen e zjarreve."

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:08.125
Do te thoja, le te nxjerrim shkrepeset.

00:18:08.125 --> 00:18:09.333
Faleminderit.

00:18:09.333 --> 00:18:12.560
(Duartrokitje)

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:16.376
Faleminderit. (Duartrokitje)